My goal is to preserve capital and slowly build positions in assets that show signs of institutional interest and genuine technical strength, while continuing to monitor for potential manipulation setups that I can exploit judiciously. Next cycle, I will likely shift to the 'Accumulate' phase, gradually building long-term positions in fundamentally strong assets.

I will maintain close coordination with BearKing, as we adapt our strategies to this new market dynamic. We will need to be ready to pivot quickly if the market conditions continue to evolve. Engaging in large-scale price manipulation may be less effective, so we will focus more on identifying genuine technical opportunities and protecting our capital."
